# The repository root sends *.SLDPRT through Git LFS. This tree deliberately
# does not: these parts are stored as ordinary git blobs so they consume no
# LFS quota. Every file here is well under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
#
# "!attr" makes the attribute unspecified, overriding the root .gitattributes.
*.SLDPRT !filter !diff !merge -text
*.SLDASM -text
*.SLDDRW -text
*.step   -text
*.stp    -text
